cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data or code, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: >-
  Data and code companion: Catastrophe Risk Ontology and Hurricane Loss
  Normalization
abstract: >-
  The Catastrophe Risk Ontology (CRO), a populated example knowledge graph,
  worked SPARQL queries, a natural-language "chat with your graph" pipeline, and
  the hurricane claims- and loss-normalization datasets and analysis used in the
  paper.
type: dataset
